@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：Kafka 普通消息发送

participant MessageTemplate
participant KafkaMessageProvider as KafkaProvider
participant KafkaProducer
queue KafkaBroker

MessageTemplate -> KafkaProvider: send(ProviderSendRequest)
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProvider: ProducerRecord(topic, messageKey, body)
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProvider: 写入 UTF-8 headers
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProducer: send(record, callback)
KafkaProducer -> KafkaBroker: produce request

alt Broker 明确确认
  KafkaBroker --> KafkaProducer: RecordMetadata
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(metadata, null)
  KafkaProvider -> KafkaProvider: kafka.topic / partition / offset
  KafkaProvider --> MessageTemplate: CONFIRMED
else 认证、授权、非法 Topic、消息过大
  KafkaBroker --> KafkaProducer: explicit error
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(null, exception)
  KafkaProvider --> MessageTemplate: REJECTED
else Timeout / RetriableException
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(null, exception)
  KafkaProvider --> MessageTemplate: UNKNOWN
else 明确客户端错误
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(null, exception)
  KafkaProvider --> MessageTemplate: FAILED
end
@enduml
